.playwright-mcp/
*baseline*.png

# Obsidian workspace state, wherever a vault is opened. quantpilot-foundation's
# validate_vault.py excludes .obsidian/ from its payload inventory (recorded as a
# compatibility refresh in its release manifest), so opening that folder directly
# in Obsidian is supported.
.obsidian/

# Knowledge vault and its meta layer. The notes are original prose but are
# derived chapter by chapter from three commercially published books, so both
# folders stay local and are never pushed to GitHub. The vault holds only
# knowledge notes for Obsidian; the meta folder holds the retired governance,
# registry, validator, and original-note layers split out on 2026-07-30.
# See docs/vault_book_ingestion_runbook.md.
quantpilot-foundation/
quantpilot-foundation-meta/

# The owner-designated book PDFs live outside this repository entirely, at
# ~/.local/qp-private-sources, so that neither git history nor OneDrive sync ever
# carries them; source-authorization-r1.md records them as
# redistribution: private_owner_only. These rules are a backstop in case a copy is
# ever dropped into the vault by mistake.
quantpilot-foundation/90-private-sources/
quantpilot-foundation/**/*.pdf
